The Project accesses third-party websites. You are responsible for ensuring your use complies with each target site's robots policy, terms of service, and applicable law. **The author accepts no liability for any data loss, account suspension, legal liability, or costs arising from your use of The Project.**

### 5. Limitation of Liability

